      "side": 1,
      "message": "Asserts may be disabled in production builds. If `get_mem_region_index_by_name` returns `-ENOENT` in such cases, this negative value will be passed to `z_riscv_pmp_change_permissions`, potentially causing issues. It would be safer to explicitly check the return value and handle the error, for example by returning an error from `mpu_lock_rollback`.",
